    "text": "Geard mid \u00fe\u00e6m leoman \u00fe\u00e6s halgan geleafan mildheortlice wear\u00f0 gefylled \u00feurh godes gyfe \u00fee on\n& se m\u00e6ra wyrhta \u00fee rihsigende wylt & gemetega\u00fe eal \u00fe\u00e6t he geworhte no be \u00fe\u00e6m anum l\u00e6tan wolde\nSo\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t ylece iglond on \u00e6rum tydum mid h\u00e6\u00feengilde afylled, \u00feearle swi\u00fee beswicyn deofolgilde\n\u00deeah hw\u00e6\u00feewe \u00feurh fultum \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feancweor\u00fean cristes gyfe & \u00feurh sanctum gregorium \u00fe\u00e6s romaniscan\nMid gewisse se fores\u00e6da bisceop \u00feurh myndgunge \u00fe\u00e6re halgan godes gyfe angan \u00e6t suman cyrre to\nHe wear\u00f0 \u00e6fter \u00feysse \u00e6scan swa swi\u00fee mid \u00fe\u00e6re bl\u00e6san so\u00feere lufe ontend \u00fe\u00e6t he swa wuldorfulle &\nHim forebod com fram eallum romanum \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6r beginnan moste ne him swa gecweme & swa\nHe \u00feeah sanctum agustinum, \u00fe\u00e6t getreowuste bearn \u00fe\u00e6s halgan geleafan, him to gespelian funde &\nHe georne \u00feone his gespelian \u00feurh \u00e6rendracan manode & l\u00e6rde \u00fe\u00e6t he georne mynstra timbryde criste\nHim eallum w\u00e6s an heorte & an saul, ne heora nan syndrige \u00e6hta n\u00e6fde ne \u00fe\u00e6t fur\u00feum ne gecw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00de\u00e6s sylfa \u00feeaw for \u00fey lange \u00feurh myndgunge \u00fe\u00e6s halgan weres on angelcynnes mynsterum for\u00feweard\nAc.\nUnderstod & wiste getreowne dyhtnere his halegra cyricena \u00e6r he gewur\u00fee mannum geswutolod.\nHe him for\u00fey m\u00e6nigfealde & genihtsume \u00e6hta & mihta gesealde.\nNe he lange ne elcode ne mihta ne ofteah.\nN\u00e6s lang to \u00fey \u00fe\u00e6t his bro\u00feor \u00feyses l\u00e6nan lifes timan geendode.\nSe \u00feurh his cildhades nytenesse \u00feis rice to stencte & his annesse tod\u00e6lde & eac swa halegra cyricena\n\u00c6fter his for\u00f0si\u00fee eadgar se fores\u00e6da cynincg \u00feurh godes gyfe ealne angelcynnes anweald begeat &\nHis foregengan \u00fee ge\u00feungene w\u00e6ron on ylde & on gleawscype swi\u00fee bescawede & forewittige on\nAc nis no to wundrienne swylce hit ungewunlic sy \u00feonne god \u00e6lmihtig m\u00e6rlice leana\u00fe \u00e6ghwylcum\nDrihten crist is \u00feearle swi\u00fee on \u00feysum \u00feingum mid ealles modes gledscype to herienne.\nSo\u00felice \u00e6lmihtig drihten \u00fee is ealra \u00feinga gewita \u00fee on \u00e6r wat eal \u00fe\u00e6t toweard is, \u00fee wiste hu fremful\nSwylce se rihtwisa & se arf\u00e6sta leangyfa no mid wordum ac mid d\u00e6dum bodede & \u00feus cw\u00e6de, Nu \u00feu\nIc \u00fee to leanes \u00feinne noman m\u00e6rsige & \u00fein rice \u00fee \u00feu under minum andwealde hyltst geeacnige & mid\nHwa is monna on angelcynne wuniende \u00fe\u00e6t nyte hu he godes rice \u00fe\u00e6t is godes cyricean \u00e6g\u00fe\u00e6r ge mid\nWitodlice sona swa he to his cynedome gecoren wear\u00fe w\u00e6s swi\u00fee gemundige his behates \u00fee he on his\nEal swa we wi\u00fe ufan cw\u00e6don \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6s gehates myngunge swi\u00fee ge\u00feancol on anginne his rices began\nHe \u00fe\u00e6r sona getimbrian het m\u00e6rlic mynster on \u00fereora geara f\u00e6ce.\n\u00de\u00e6t wile \u00feincan ungeleaflic eallum \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee \u00fea stowe on uferum tidum geseo\u00f0 & \u00feis ne gemuna\u00fe.\nHe \u00fe\u00e6t ilce mynster \u00feus gehradod het sancta marian gehalgian gode to lofe & to weor\u00feunge & \u00fe\u00e6r to\n\u00c6r \u00fe\u00e6m lyt muneca w\u00e6s on feawum storum on swa miclum rice \u00fee be rihtum regule lifdon.\nN\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t na fealdre \u00feonne on are stowe seo is gl\u00e6stingabyrig gehaten \u00f0\u00e6r his f\u00e6der eadmund cynincg\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re stowe w\u00e6s se foresprecena abbud genumen & gehadod to \u00fe\u00e6m fores\u00e6dan mynstre \u00fee eadgar\nHe \u00feearle swi\u00fee wear\u00fe gegladod \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t gastlice munyca angin & geornlice angan to smeagenne\nHit eac swa on bocum awriten is, se \u00fee god beginnan \u00feence he \u00fe\u00e6t angin on him sylfum astelle.\n\u00c6fter \u00feam \u00fee he sylf geriht wear\u00f0 began georne mynstera wide geond his cynerice to rihtl\u00e6cynne &\n\u00de\u00e6t swa wear\u00f0 gel\u00e6st \u00feurh \u00fea fultumigendan godes gife.\nBreac \u00fea gesinlice dunstanes his ercebisceopes r\u00e6des, \u00feurh his myndgunge he w\u00e6s smeagende embe\nHalige stowa he gecl\u00e6nsode fram ealra manna fulnessum no \u00fe\u00e6t an on wesseaxna rice ac eac swylce\nWitodlice he adref \u00fea canonicas \u00fee on \u00fe\u00e6m fores\u00e6dum gyltum ofer de genihtsumedon & on \u00feam\nAn sumum stowum eac swilce he mynec\u00e6na gesta\u00feolode and \u00fea \u00e6lf\u00fery\u00fee his gebeddan bet\u00e6hte \u00fe\u00e6t\nHe sylf w\u00e6s a smeagende ymb muneca gesundfulnesse & wel willende hi to \u00feam myngode \u00fe\u00e6t heo\nHe began mid geornfulre scrudnunge smeagan & ahsian be \u00feam gebodum \u00fe\u00e6s halgan regules & witan\nHe wolde eac swylce \u00feurh \u00feone regul oncnawan \u00fea wislican gefadunge \u00fee snotorlice geset is be\n\u00deurh \u00feises wisdomes lust he het \u00feisne regul of l\u00e6den gereorde on englisc ge\u00feeodan.\n\u00deeah \u00fea scearp\u00feanclan witan \u00fee \u00feone twyd\u00e6ledan wisdom hlutorlice tocnawa\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t is andweardra\nIs \u00feeah niedbehefe ungel\u00e6redum woroldmonnum \u00fey for helle wites ogan & for cristes lufan \u00feis\nIc \u00fea \u00feas ge\u00feeode to micclan gesceade telede.\nWel m\u00e6g dugan hit naht mid hwylcan gereorde mon sy gestryned & to \u00fean so\u00fean geleafan gew\u00e6med\nH\u00e6bben for \u00fei \u00fea ungel\u00e6redan inlendisce \u00fe\u00e6s halgan regules cy\u00fe\u00fee \u00feurh agenes gereordes\nFor \u00fei \u00feonne ic mid ealre estfulnesse mine \u00e6ftergengan bidde & \u00feurh drihtnes naman halsige \u00fe\u00e6t hy\nNe gedyrstl\u00e6ce heora nan \u00feurh deofles myndgunge o\u00fe\u00fee \u00feurh \u00e6nige gitsunge \u00fe\u00e6t he godes are\n\u00de\u00e6s \u00fee ic wene sio \u00e6f\u00e6stnes \u00fe\u00e6s halgan regules on \u00e6rum tidum gewanod wear\u00fe \u00feurh reaflac yfelra\nIs swi\u00fee miclan us eallum to warnienne & ure drihten to biddenne \u00fe\u00e6t sio yrm\u00fe on ure \u00e6festnesse\nAbbodissum we eac t\u00e6ca\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hi inholde sin and \u00fe\u00e6s halgan regoles gebodum eallum mode \u00feeowigen\nGif heora hwilc mid deofles costnunge beswicen for gode o\u00fe\u00fee for worulde gyltig bi\u00fe ne gladige on\nNe sy la nan eor\u00f0cund cyning mid gitsunge to \u00fe\u00e6m swi\u00fee undergan \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6m heofoncundum\nGif cinges gerefena hwylc gyltig bi\u00fe wi\u00fe gode o\u00fe\u00fee wi\u00fe men hwa is manna to \u00feam ungescead and\nStande for \u00fei on \u00fe\u00e6t ilice gerad on ecnesse swa hw\u00e6t swa \u00fe\u00e6m ecum criste geseald bi\u00fe on cyricena\n\u00de\u00e6t, la, ne geweor\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t minra \u00e6ftergengenna \u00e6nig \u00fea yrm\u00fee geearnige.",
